{
  "id": 346107460,
  "iid": 18269,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Adds consistent treatment for GAD ellipse orientation",
  "description": "Closes #20242 \n\n- Orientation of major axis for ellipse uncertainty values now show as un-decoded values for all relevant shape types. Previously, Shape Type 9 would show decoded, while other shape types were un-decoded.\n- Decoded values are displayed as additional information for all relevant shape types.\n\nBefore:\n- Input value 28 (hex) would appear as 40 (decimal) for shape type 3, but 80 (decimal) for shape type 9.\n```\ntshark -r shape_type_3_orientation_40.pcap.gz -T pdml | grep orientation\n      <field name=\"gsm_a.gad.orientation_of_major_axis\" showname=\"Orientation of major axis: 40\" size=\"1\" pos=\"273\" show=\"40\" value=\"28\"/>\n\n$ tshark -r shape_type_9_orientation_40.pcap.gz -T pdml | grep orientation\n      <field name=\"gsm_a.gad.orientation_of_major_axis\" showname=\"Orientation of major axis: 80\" size=\"1\" pos=\"275\" show=\"80\" value=\"28\"/>\n```\n\nThis MR:\n- Input value 28 (hex) shows corresponding value 40 (decimal), with the intended interpretation (80 degrees), more clearly.\n```\n/workspaces/wireshark # ./build/run/tshark -r data/shape_type_3_orientation_40.pcap.gz  -T pdml | grep orientation\n      <field name=\"gsm_a.gad.orientation_of_major_axis\" showname=\"Orientation of major axis: 40 (80 degrees)\" size=\"1\" pos=\"273\" show=\"40\" value=\"28\"/>\n\n/workspaces/wireshark # ./build/run/tshark -r data/shape_type_9_orientation_40.pcap.gz -T pdml | grep orientation\n      <field name=\"gsm_a.gad.orientation_of_major_axis\" showname=\"Orientation of major axis: 40 (80 degrees)\" size=\"1\" pos=\"275\" show=\"40\" value=\"28\"/>\n```",
  "state": "merged",
